 "is_vocab": false,
 "stimulus_html": "Given the data 10, 12, 14, 18, 21, 23, 24, 25, 29, and 30, compute the following without technology:",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 529208,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "The value at the 30th percentile",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>If <i>p</i> percent of the values in a dataset are less than a number <i>n</i>, then we say that <i>n</i> is at the <i>p</i>th percentile.</p>\n<p>The data values are already in increasing order: 10, 12, 14, 18, 21, 23, 24, 25, 29, 30</p>\n<p>There are 10 data values.</p>\n<p>At the 30<sup>th</sup> percentile, 30% of the values are smaller than the number.</p>\n<p>30 percent of 10 data values is three values.</p>\n<p>In this set, three out of the 10 numbers are less than 18.</p>\n<p>The value at the 30<sup>th</sup> percentile is 18.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "18\n"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 529209,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "The value at the first quintile",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Quintiles measure in fifths, or in steps of 20%. The first quintile is the 20<sup>th</sup> percentile.</p>\n<p>If <i>p</i> percent of the values in a dataset are less than a number <i>n</i>, then we say that <i>n</i> is at the <i>p</i>th percentile.</p>\n<p>The data values are already in increasing order: 10, 12, 14, 18, 21, 23, 24, 25, 29, 30</p>\n<p>There are 10 data values.</p>\n<p>At the 20<sup>th</sup> percentile, 20% of the values are smaller than the number.</p>\n<p>20 percent of 10 values is 2 values.</p>\n<p>In this set, two out of the 10 numbers are less than 14.</p>\n<p>The value at the 20<sup>th</sup> percentile (first quintile) is 14.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "14"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
