     "content_html": "<p>If <i>p</i> percent of the values in a dataset are less than a number <i>n</i>, then we say that <i>n</i> is at the <i>p</i>th percentile.</p>\n<p>The data values are already in increasing order: 10, 12, 14, 18, 21, 23, 24, 25, 29, 30</p>\n<p>There are 10 data values.</p>\n<p>Eight of the ten values, or 80% of the data, are less than 29.</p>\n<p>29 is at the 80<sup>th</sup> percentile.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
